STEP 1 — DELTA
[NEW] spc.n26.com: The `/v1/transactions`, `/v1/payments`, `/v1/tokens`, `/api/v1` "HTTP 200 API endpoints" are NOT data — all serve `Content-Type: image/gif` 43-byte 1x1 transparent pixel (!) via regex route `^(/api/)?v\d+/\w+$`, set an `sp=` HttpOnly SameSite=None 1yr cookie + P3P header, ACAO `*`/reflected-`Origin` + `Allow-Credentials: true`. This is an analytics collector (Snowplow-style `sp=` cookie), not a payment service. IDOR-on-payments premise collapses.
[NEW] spc.n26.com/health: GET-only 200 `OK` (text/plain, len 2); HEAD returns 404 — the earlier "/health rotated to 404" was a method artifact, not rotation.
[NO_DELTA] app.n26.com (319204-byte shell, 6th identical probe), flags.n26.com (all /v1/* 403), my.n26.com (Envoy 301, no takeover).

